1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 2=

5
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,640
You really got married?

6
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,439
I thought your marriage certificate
was a fake.

7
00:00:15,839 --> 00:00:17,320
Why'd you call me over in such a rush?

8
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:19,640
I was shopping with my fiancee.

9
00:00:22,039 --> 00:00:23,359
Ask him.

10
00:00:27,399 --> 00:00:28,160
That drink last night was no good?

11
00:00:28,679 --> 00:00:29,359
No way!

12
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,679
My fiancee and I tried it a few times.

13
00:00:32,159 --> 00:00:33,600
Kicked in right away, every time.

14
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:35,640
We went all night. Never got tired.

15
00:00:37,359 --> 00:00:37,840
What?

16
00:00:38,799 --> 00:00:39,320
Couldn't get it up?

17
00:00:39,799 --> 00:00:40,479
You've got some nerve.

18
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,320
I'll deal with you later.

19
00:00:44,560 --> 00:00:45,000
Ye.

20
00:00:45,359 --> 00:00:45,960
Guess what?

21
00:00:46,439 --> 00:00:48,079
Zhouhan really got married!

22
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:51,119
Bao'er says she's an upperclassman
at Jiang University!

23
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:53,719
There's a beauty like that
in the School of Architecture?

24
00:00:55,119 --> 00:00:56,560
You sure move fast.

25
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:57,960
Straight to marriage!

26
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:00,320
You know Zhouhan.

27
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:02,679
He only cares about results.

28
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:03,759
He doesn't waste time.

29
00:01:04,560 --> 00:01:05,159
Enough.

30
00:01:05,799 --> 00:01:07,239
I called you here to ask you something.

31
00:01:08,879 --> 00:01:11,079
You drank the wrong stuff last night.

32
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,239
Don't blame me.

33
00:01:15,159 --> 00:01:16,000
What are you scared of?

34
00:01:16,640 --> 00:01:17,640
Without your drink,

35
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,719
would Zhouhan have won her over

36
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,680
so fast?

37
00:01:29,319 --> 00:01:30,000
Tell me,

38
00:01:30,599 --> 00:01:33,040
how do you help someone let go
of the past?

39
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,040
Zhouhan.

40
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:36,799
Are you serious?

41
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,400
No.

42
00:01:42,959 --> 00:01:43,599
I was just...

43
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:45,239
asking.

44
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:46,359
Just curious.

45
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:49,879
I just flirt.

46
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:51,519
I date around,

47
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,840
but never get attached.

48
00:01:54,159 --> 00:01:54,920
Can't help you there.

49
00:01:55,959 --> 00:01:56,920
I can help with that.

50
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,640
First,

51
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:00,280
be generous.

52
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,640
Buy her cars, houses, jewelry.

53
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,120
Next,

54
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:06,599
be romantic.

55
00:02:07,599 --> 00:02:08,680
Quit working late all the time.

56
00:02:09,439 --> 00:02:10,919
Candlelit dinners, stargazing...

57
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:11,719
Have them all.

58
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:13,039
Last

59
00:02:14,159 --> 00:02:15,319
but most important,

60
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:18,520
seduce her.

61
00:02:24,280 --> 00:02:25,479
Zhouhan, listen to this guy!

62
00:02:25,599 --> 00:02:27,599
You've already slept together.

63
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,000
Keep winning her over.

64
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,000
With your looks and body,

65
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,759
what woman could say no?

66
00:02:44,919 --> 00:02:46,000
Let's leave it to time.

67
00:02:46,719 --> 00:02:47,240
I believe

68
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:49,520
she'll let go someday.

69
00:02:54,720 --> 00:02:55,879
(The Greenroom)

70
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:56,840
(Jiang AF42451)
Mommy!

71
00:02:59,439 --> 00:03:00,520
(That's her mom?)

72
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,159
(Yeah.)

73
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:03,719
Mommy! You're finally here!

74
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:04,719
Don't call me that.

75
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:08,159
At home and outside,
we keep things separate.

76
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,800
What if someone hears you?

77
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:11,840
Dad made me!

78
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,400
He said if I don't call you Mommy,

79
00:03:14,599 --> 00:03:16,319
he'll freeze my bank account.

80
00:03:17,039 --> 00:03:17,960
My bestie is my mom now!

81
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:19,719
No one can mess with us!

82
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:21,599
Let's go.

83
00:03:22,640 --> 00:03:26,360
(The Greenroom, Jiang AF42451)

84
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:28,680
So pretty!

85
00:03:39,199 --> 00:03:40,240
Why is there a pink mark here?

86
00:03:42,400 --> 00:03:43,840
It's a pink mark.

87
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:46,599
N-No...

88
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:47,759
It's not...

89
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,280
There are lots of mosquitoes lately.

90
00:03:50,319 --> 00:03:51,120
One bit me.

91
00:03:51,800 --> 00:03:52,680
Tell me the truth.

92
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,759
Did my dad do something to you?

93
00:03:55,439 --> 00:03:56,400
No!

94
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,919
You two actually slept together?

95
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,000
Keep it down!

96
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:12,199
Dad used being drunk as an excuse!

97
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:14,680
Hua.

98
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:16,439
Look,

99
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:18,279
if my dad ever mistreats you,

100
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,360
I'll make his life miserable!

101
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:21,959
Just freeze my account again. Who cares?

102
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:28,439
We are husband and wife, after all.

103
00:04:30,160 --> 00:04:31,639
It's just he was drunk last night.

104
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,720
I don't know how it happened.

105
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:37,879
Listen,

106
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:39,600
you're husband and wife for real now.

107
00:04:39,839 --> 00:04:40,519
If you two ever fight,

108
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,800
I'll take your side, not his.

109
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:45,680
Really?

110
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:47,399
Of course!

111
00:04:50,199 --> 00:04:51,319
Gu Zheng?

112
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,959
That jerk has the nerve to show up?

113
00:04:55,319 --> 00:04:56,120
I'll go beat him up!

114
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,279
Don't do anything rash.

115
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:01,920
Hua.

116
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,879
Enough with the sulking.

117
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,560
Come home with me.

118
00:05:06,399 --> 00:05:07,160
Mom and Dad miss you.

119
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,120
Mr. Gu,

120
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:10,959
I can make my own decisions.

121
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,519
I'll always be grateful for

122
00:05:12,560 --> 00:05:13,399
what your family did for me.

123
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,600
I'll visit your parents when I can.

124
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,480
Do you have to be so distant?

125
00:05:23,319 --> 00:05:23,879
Mr. Gu,

126
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:26,120
you're the one who said

127
00:05:26,319 --> 00:05:27,959
I'm just a girl your family took in

128
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:30,439
and I have nothing to do with you.

129
00:05:35,120 --> 00:05:35,560
Let's go.

130
00:05:38,920 --> 00:05:39,360
I...

131
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:42,879
Gu, consider this a warning.

132
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:44,759
Hua's part of the Xie family now.

133
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:47,360
Don't mess with her.

134
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,480
Let's go.

135
00:05:57,959 --> 00:05:59,480
It's so much nicer out in the country.

136
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:01,920
Hua.

137
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:03,600
Look.

138
00:06:03,879 --> 00:06:04,720
Isn't that my dad?

139
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,399
You told him?

140
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,680
You two slept together.

141
00:06:18,839 --> 00:06:19,959
He owes you something for that.

142
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:21,639
Even if you don't like him,

143
00:06:21,959 --> 00:06:22,720
take his money.

144
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:25,439
You can't give him everything
and get nothing back!

145
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,079
Come on.

146
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:31,120
Dad!

147
00:06:34,720 --> 00:06:35,639
There's a rose garden nearby.

148
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:37,040
Want to take a look?

149
00:06:38,399 --> 00:06:39,360
A rose garden?

150
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:44,439
It's a wedding gift to you.

151
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,664
♪You say♪

152
00:07:03,665 --> 00:07:05,440
♪You don't need anyone to lean on♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

153
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:08,840
♪You're just fine on your own♪

154
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:12,000
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

155
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:15,000
♪And the pain you face at night♪

156
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:18,680
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

157
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:21,840
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

158
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:24,920
♪Some love needs no promises♪

159
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:28,280
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

160
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:30,960
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

161
00:07:31,080 --> 00:07:34,200
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

162
00:07:34,400 --> 00:07:37,160
♪I'm right behind you♪

163
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:40,680
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

164
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:43,320
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

165
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:47,320
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

166
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:53,520
♪I'm right behind you♪

167
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:55,400
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

168
00:07:55,520 --> 00:07:57,240
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

169
00:07:57,320 --> 00:07:59,680
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

170
00:07:59,880 --> 00:08:01,240
♪I'm right behind you♪

171
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:03,600
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

172
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:05,360
♪I won't claim you♪

173
00:08:05,480 --> 00:08:07,040
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

174
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:09,720
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

175
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:13,080
♪Waiting for you♪
